            <ArticleTitle>Editorial: lanthanide compounds for therapeutic and diagnostic applications.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>499</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The medical applications of lanthanides are diverse: MRI contrast agents, hypophosphatemic agents for kidney dialysis patients, luminescent probes in cell studies, and for palliation of bone pain in osteosarcoma.</AbstractText>
